  Got: Crocodile was very happy to hear Mouse-deer call to him again. “Oh, Mouse-deer, I’m hungry. I want to eat one side of Cow’s thigh, but he won’t let me. He is very stubborn. He wants to have a trial first,” said Crocodile.
